<section class="doctor">
  <div class="doctor__container">
    <div
      class="doctor__card1 cards"
      data-aos="fade-up"
      data-aos-duration="1500">
      <div
        class="doctor__card1-img"
        data-aos="zoom-in"
        data-aos-duration="1200"
        data-aos-delay="200">
      </div>
      <div
        class="doctor__card1-content"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-duration="1200"
        data-aos-delay="400">
        <h2 class="doctor__card1-title">
          與樹木共生<br />
          我們不能失去樹木
        </h2>
        <p class="doctor__card1-text">
          樹與我們共生，所以我們不能失去樹木，失去樹木就沒有所謂的生態，更沒有共生，我們也沒有辦法跟自然共榮。
        </p>
        <p class="doctor__card1-name">樹木醫生 ︱ 詹鳳春</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="doctor__card2 cards"
      data-aos="fade-up"
      data-aos-duration="1500">
      <div
        class="doctor__card2-img"
        data-aos="zoom-in"
        data-aos-duration="1200"
        data-aos-delay="200">
      </div>
      <div
        class="doctor__card2-content"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-duration="1200"
        data-aos-delay="400">
        <h2 class="doctor__card2-title">
          享受運動<br />
          每天7000步促進健康
        </h2>
        <p class="doctor__card2-text">
          去享受運動，讓運動變成常態。每天走路7000步，達到健康促進的效果，再走更多便能享受體能進步的成效。
        </p>
        <p class="doctor__card2-name">
          臺灣健身運動醫學推廣協會<br class="doctor_br" />理事長 ︱ 陳俊忠
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '../style/_variable.scss' as *;
  .doctor {
    width: 100%;
    background-color: $BGColor;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    &__container {
      padding: 96px 155px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: stretch;
      gap: 30px;
      @media screen and (max-width: 1600px) {
        padding: 66px 55px;
        gap: 20px;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 1366px) {
        padding: 32px 24px;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 640px) {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      .cards {
        width: 99.9%;
        display: flex;
        padding: 30px;
        background-color: $mainColor;
        border-top-left-radius: 100px;
        box-shadow: 4px 4px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1);
        @media screen and (max-width: 1054px) {
          padding: 20px;
        }
        @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {
          flex-direction: column;
        }
      }
    }
    &__card1,
    &__card2 {
      &-content {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        color: $whiteColor;
        text-align: justify;
        line-height: 33px;
      }
      &-title {
        font-size: 25px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 40px;
        text-align: justify;
        @media screen and (max-width: 1280px) {
          font-size: 23px;
        }
        @media screen and (min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 1280px) {
          margin-top: 0px;
        }
      }
      &-text {
        font-size: 20px;
        margin-top: 18px;
        @media screen and (max-width: 1280px) {
          font-size: 18px;
        }
      }
      &-name {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 18px;
        @media screen and (max-width: 1280px) {
          font-size: 18px;
        }
        .doctor_br {
          @media screen and (min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 1126px) {
            display: none;
          }
        }
      }
      &-img {
        margin-right: 30px;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        background-position: center;
        background-size: cover;
        min-width: 238px;
        min-height: 379px;
        height: auto;
        border-top-left-radius: 70px;
        @media screen and (max-width: 1366px) {
          margin-right: 15px;
        }
        @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {
          margin-right: 0px;
          width: 100%;
          border-top-left-radius: 90px;
          min-height: 600px;
        }
        @media screen and (max-width: 900px) {
          min-height: 500px;
        }
        @media screen and (max-width: 640px) {
          background-position: center top;
          min-height: 600px;
        }
        @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
          min-height: 460px;
        }
        @media screen and (max-width: 414px) {
          min-height: 400px;
        }
      }
    }
    &__card1 {
      &-img {
        background-image: url('../imgs/doctor1.png');
      }
    }
    &__card2 {
      &-img {
        background-image: url('../imgs/doctor2.png');
      }
    }
  }
</style>
